  m_Name: PlaceFoundation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TowerDefence.Battlefield::TowerDefence.Battlefield.TutorialDefinition
  Id: PlaceFoundation
  Title: Navy foundations
  Pages:
  - Navy foundations must be built on an empty water grid cell before a tower can
    be mounted. Foundations cannot overlap other structures.
  - Normal gives 1x tower range; Medium gives 1.25x; High gives 1.75x. Each supports
    one Navy structure on its top mounting point.
